  "bodyHash": "606f0c2a298fdbea",
  "content": "\n\n<center>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><img style=display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"35\"></p>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/dark_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<p><img style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/showcase.png\"></p>\n\n</center>\n<hr>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>&laquo;受夠了 Minecraft 基本的使用者介面嗎？每次靠近附魔桌卻只看到和合成桌一樣灰暗的選單，讓你感到厭煩嗎？想為你的遊戲增添一些色彩嗎？</p>\n<p>隆重推出《色彩容器》（Colourful Containers）！這是一款容器 GUI 替換模組，希望能為 Minecraft 中各種色彩繽紛的互動方塊匹配專屬的選單風格。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>—— Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h2 style=\"line-height: normal;\">現在，我帶來了完全&nbsp;<strong>重製</strong>、<strong>重繪材質</strong>、<strong>重新構想</strong>的版本 &ndash; Recolourful Containers</strong>！支援最新版本、全新材質，帶來更深的沉浸體驗！</h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\">所有 GUI 設計皆靈感來自其對應的方塊。修復了原版 Minecraft 材質問題、調整了 HUD 介面，甚至包含原版動畫 GUI，以及更多更多&nbsp;<strong>超強功能！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>變更材質圖示：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2988\" height=\"5328\"></p>\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>變更材質清單：</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>合成桌</li>\n<li>鐵砧&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>附魔桌&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>煉藥鍋</li>\n<li>紡織機</li>\n<li>製圖台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>石工台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>砂轮</li>\n<li>鍛造台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>製造機&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>投擲器、發射器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>熔爐、高爐、煙燻爐&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>帶箱子的船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>帶箱子的礦車</li>\n<li>鸚鵡螺與殭屍鸚鵡螺</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>背包</li>\n<li>配方書</li>\n<li>書</li>\n<li>信標</li>\n<li>狀態列（HUD）</li>\n<li>經驗條&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>部分小型介面調整與修復</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>「Vanilla+」功能 </strong>（請閱讀「安裝指南」以獲取更多資訊）<strong>：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>帶有職業的村民 GUI&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>終界箱&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>馬、骸骨馬、殭屍馬</li>\n<li>駱駝、騾子、驢、羊駱</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>OptiFine / OptiGUI 專屬功能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>帶有所有類型與職業組合的村民 GUI <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>（Animatica 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>聖誕節箱子</li>\n<li>帶有變體的銅箱子 <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>木桶 <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>彩色潛影盒</li>\n<li>馬、骸骨馬、殭屍馬</li>\n<li>駱駝、騾子、驢（含與不含箱子 - <em>OptiGUI 獨佔</em>）</li>\n<li>羊駱（含地毯顏色變化）</li>\n<li>有裂痕、受損的鐵砧 <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>已寫入的書 <em>（OptiGUI + Animatica 獨佔）&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>講台上的書 <em>（OptiGUI 3.0+ 獨佔）</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模組相容性：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accessories（飾品配件）</li>\n<li>Armor Chroma（盔甲染色）</li>\n<li>Axiom（公理）</li>\n<li>Backslot <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>Charm of Undying <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>Better Enchanting（更好的附魔）</li>\n<li>Cloth Config（布料設定）</li>\n<li>Detail Armor Bar（精細盔甲條）</li>\n<li>ItemSwapper（物品切換）</li>\n<li>Language Reload（語言重新載入）</li>\n<li>Mod Menu（模組選單）</li>\n<li>Recursive Resources（遞迴資源）</li>\n<li>Sawmill（鋸木機）</li>\n<li>What Are They Up To（他們在忙什麼）</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<center>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">若想獲得完整體驗，必須安裝 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine</h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/optigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n</center>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>如果您不想使用 OptiGUI，或者僅使用 OptiFine 模組，您可以在語言設定中啟用內建的「Vanilla+」模式</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用方法：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"340\"></p>\n<p>如需其他語言支援，請使用主檔案下方版本頁面底部的獨立 VANILLA+ 套件</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth_additional_files.png\" width=\"627\" height=\"267\" alt=\"\"></p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&amp;a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<details>\n<summary>常見問題：</summary>\n<h4><strong>問：關於任何未在此列表中的問題，我該在哪裡提問？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>加入&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Recolourful Discord 伺服器</a> 並在那裡提問吧！</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>已知問題清單：</summary>\n<h4><strong>搭配 OptiFine 時：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民職業功能無法正常運作</li>\n<li>木桶會顯示箱子的 GUI 材質</li>\n<li>帶箱子的船會顯示上次訪問過的類似箱子的容器 GUI 材質</li>\n<li>不支援部分馬類生物</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若您僅使用 OptiFine，建議啟用「Vanilla+」模式</p>\n</details>\n\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>問：箱子／潛影盒／村民職業的 GUI 無法運作！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請檢查是否已安裝 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或是否已將語言切換為&nbsp;「Vanilla+」</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：你能為某個模組（X mod）新增支援嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>簡短回答：理論上可以。請在評論區留下您的建議，或在 Discord 提交！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我可以在整合包中使用 Recolourful Containers 嗎？／我可以修改它嗎？／我可以對它進行 X 操作嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請查看描述底部的「使用條款」</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我想支持你！該怎麼做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>關於這點&hellip;</p>\n</details>\n\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1501\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<h3>如果您不想架設伺服器但仍想支持我，<strong>請將此套件分享給您的朋友，或在 YouTube、TikTok、Instagram 等平台展示！ </strong>只要留下此頁面的連結即可，我會非常感激！</h3>\n<hr>\n<center>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>別忘了按讚並追蹤，以獲取未來更新！</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth.png\" width=\"215\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n</center>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/chris_xeno/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Chris_XENO</a></strong> 提供原始《Colorful Containers》材質包</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Shrimpsnail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Shrimpsnail</a></strong> 協助編寫自訂着色器程式碼，許多功能得以實現皆感謝他的貢獻</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Kryqu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Kryqu</a></strong> 為村民 GUI 設計提供靈感</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/terms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用條款：</summary>\n<p><strong>如果您認為自己無法對本套件進行某些操作，請事先與我聯繫詢問 :)</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>您可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>將此套件包含在免費的整合包中</li>\n<li>將此套件用於您的私人伺服器</li>\n<li>修改此套件（限個人使用）</li>\n<li>在任何媒體形式中使用此套件，包括 YouTube、Twitch 等</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>您不可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未經本人同意，不得以任何形式在任何平台上分發此套件、其資源檔或修改後的資源檔</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<hr>",
